if (!conn.connected) {
  targetPeerId = transport.transportPeerId;
  listenAddrs = transport.listenAddrs;
  conn = mesh.getPeerConnectionInfo(targetPeerId);
}
```

So: if `liveConnected` exists and is connected, `targetPeerId` is the live connected peer ID. If not, it falls back to `transport.transportPeerId`.

Then the dial is attempted:
